From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:11:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1342/3799] soh: rename func_80BA2600 ->
 ObjWarp2block_SetupActive

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: installs the main action once the partner has been found.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Warp2block/z_obj_warp2block.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Warp2block/z_obj_warp2block.c  | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Warp2block/z_obj_warp2block.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Warp2block/z_obj_warp2block.c
index ab0ebc453..a08061ebd 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Warp2block/z_obj_warp2block.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Warp2block/z_obj_warp2block.c
@@ -34,7 +34,8 @@ void ObjWarp2block_DoNothing(ObjWarp2block* this, PlayState* play);
 void ObjWarp2block_SetupFindPartner(ObjWarp2block* this);  // was func_80BA24E8 [LLM:HIGH]
 // LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80BA24F8: scans the item-action actor list for the other Obj_Warp2block sharing this switch flag and adopts it as a child, swapping the pair immediately when the flag is already set; after 60 frames without a match it complains and kills the actor.
 void ObjWarp2block_FindPartner(ObjWarp2block* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_80BA24F8 [LLM:HIGH]
-void func_80BA2600(ObjWarp2block* this);
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80BA2600: installs the main action once the partner has been found.
+void ObjWarp2block_SetupActive(ObjWarp2block* this);  // was func_80BA2600 [LLM:HIGH]
 void func_80BA2610(ObjWarp2block* this, PlayState* play);
 
 const ActorInit Obj_Warp2block_InitVars = {
@@ -263,7 +264,7 @@ void ObjWarp2block_FindPartner(ObjWarp2block* this, PlayState* play) {
                 ObjWarp2block_SwapWithChild(this, play);
                 this->dyna.actor.draw = ObjWarp2block_Draw;
             }
-            func_80BA2600(this);
+            ObjWarp2block_SetupActive(this);  // was func_80BA2600 [LLM:HIGH]
             return;
         }
 
@@ -279,7 +280,7 @@ void ObjWarp2block_FindPartner(ObjWarp2block* this, PlayState* play) {
     }
 }
 
-void func_80BA2600(ObjWarp2block* this) {
+void ObjWarp2block_SetupActive(ObjWarp2block* this) {
     this->actionFunc = func_80BA2610;
 }
 
